<span class="icon icon-none" title="@Model.Text"></span>
<span class="title">@Model.Text</span>
@* The unread conversations waiting on the user. It is filled in by the page's messaging script once the page has
   loaded, and kept current as messages arrive, so the menu itself never waits on a count and stays the same for
   everyone who sees it. While it shows, the Messaging group's icon turns red, so a collapsed menu still says so. It
   stays hidden for anyone without the workspace, whose pages carry no such script. *@
<span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-danger ms-auto me-3 align-self-center flex-shrink-0 d-none" title="@T["Unread conversations waiting for you"]" data-messaging-attention-badge data-admin-menu-attention></span>
